#: ../../howto/install.rst:15
msgid "Homebrew selects the release archive for our processor and checks its SHA-256. The executable has the Typst compiler built in and links Graphviz, which Homebrew installs with it. We do not need a Rust toolchain, a Python environment, or a separate Typst installation to build HTML and PDF. The release requires macOS 12 or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../howto/install.rst:20
msgid "The package also installs two more programs. ``dsc`` keeps discussion catalogs and builds them with this ``guidedog`` (see :doc:`discussions`). ``guidedog-pages`` publishes sites to GitHub Pages (see :doc:`github-pages`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../howto/install.rst:24
